flowchart TD
  A[Public source list] --> B[Normalize lead fields]
  B --> C{Duplicate?}
  C -- Yes --> D[Update existing audit trail]
  C -- No --> E[Create candidate record]
  E --> F[Public enrichment]
  F --> G[AI-assisted fit scoring]
  G --> H{Confidence threshold met?}
  H -- High confidence --> I[Review queue: ready]
  H -- Low confidence --> J[Review queue: needs human judgment]
  I --> K{Human decision}
  J --> K
  K -- Approve --> L[Outreach-ready handoff]
  K -- Reject --> M[Archive with reason]
  K -- Needs research --> N[Research backlog]

